    "updated_at": "2025-01-28T09:27:43Z",
    "body": "Not sure, if you really wanted a label to appear empty it's possible in all engines I suspect, it just depends on how persistent you are. (I would imagine whitespace of the non-ASCII variety to work in Chromium, for instance.)\n\nThere's probably not a good use case for that though.\n\nSo since all engines are different and it doesn't really matter, I guess I would opt for not changing the specification.",
