    "updated_at": "2025-03-11T18:43:06Z",
    "body": "Here is the failure that the test was having with firefox: https://wpt.fyi/analyzer?screenshot=sha1%3A15c13852007b1d50a37a540385db278341608f6c&screenshot=sha1%3A52d883c5376d0b98e85d013b4fc4f55d0b09fc41\n\nThe reason is because these two selects render differently in firefox, but the same in webkit/chrome:\n```html\n<select>\n  <option label=\"  \"></option>\n</select>\n<br>\n<select>\n  <option>  </option>\n</select>\n```\nWhat do you think the correct behavior is?",
