    "updated_at": "2025-03-13T22:01:58Z",
    "body": "I see now that chromium strips/simplifies whitespace for the label attribute just like it does for text content, but the spec only says to do it for text content. https://source.chromium.org/chromium/chromium/src/+/main:third_party/blink/renderer/core/html/forms/html_option_element.cc;l=163-167;drc=2129668fca1f5aeded3cb1ed2f3280141ef03879\n\nI'll update chromium and add a mismatch reftest",
